Z||000021||California Kid||07-22-2001||11:13 PM||||If you go with those white seats, make sure you don't use the "Carbomet" disc brake pads, the black dust gets everywhere!!! Going to change my pads this season, because my tan seats get dirty from it. Working or cleaning the car for shows, this stuff gets on your pants when you rub lightly against lower body panels. You sit in the seat and "walla" you grind it into the leather. Brakes work fantasic, but they're dirty (Bob from Canada recommends a Titanium metallic pad for same performance not as dirty, have to check into it).||||reg||6
